{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>About this Game:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person shooter as a machine gun tank. You will start in a base layer to prepare yourself. Each and every run in a closed underground dungeon will have random environment event. Big Priest will spawn as boss who can give different temporary perks to buff yourself upon killing her. Kill as many skeletons as you can to earn more rubies. You can shoot off their limbs and head! Purchase different hats to decorate your tank.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeletons swarm in an underground dungeon. You must protect the Goddess from being destroy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Feature:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run &amp; Gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rubies &amp; Gold coins Drops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuttable Limbs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Shooting/Killing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Hour Record","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603890/7328d24f74bc430b402bfccf1d6c80ca9168b01c.jpg"},{"name":"All Cosmetic Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603890/d4239e8fd5e09eb703c7610de27a94764109a7c4.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603890?t=1773592768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603890?t=1773592768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603890/4f51d07f49ad4270be691331b1e758bf03163868/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773592768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603890/4f51d07f49ad4270be691331b1e758bf03163868/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=177